<title>USA: TABLE- Crescent Real Q2 net and FFO rise.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Crescent Real Q2 net and FFO rise.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.28		    $0.13</p>
<p> Shr FFO		     0.44		     0.33</p>
<p> Net			   25.1			6.3</p>
<p> FFO			   44.9		     19.0</p>
<p> Revs			  99.1		     45.0</p>
<p> Avg shrs		    89.6		     47.1</p>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.52		    $0.28</p>
<p> Shr FFO		     0.83		     0.64</p>
<p> Net			   41.8		     13.3</p>
<p> FFO			   78.5		     36.7</p>
<p> Revs			 183.2		     88.1</p>
<p> Avg			   81.0		     47.1</p>
<p>(All data above in milions except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Crescent Real Estate Equities Co took $1.3 million charge, or $0.03 a share, in the second quarter of 1996.</p>
